  - [1mNative markup only[0m — a [38;5;153m<label><input type="checkbox"> …</label>[39m per item, hardcoded in [38;5;153mindex.html[39m. The browser
    handles on/off; zero JS. Cheapest, and cheap to change later. Rules out adding items dynamically until you add JS.
  - [1mSmall JS factory[0m — a [38;5;153mcreateCheckbox(label)[39m function in a [38;5;153m<script>[39m (or [38;5;153mapp.js[39m) that returns the element and tracks
