    decision you'd inherit later.
  - [1mPersisted state[0m — either of the above plus [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m, so checks survive reload. This one is [3mnot[0m cheap to reverse
    cleanly; it introduces a storage key format.

  [1mMy recommendation: native markup only.[0m You said basic on/off, nothing fancy — native checkboxes already give you
  exactly that, and adding a JS layer before there's anything to drive it is structure you'd likely rewrite once real
  task data shows up.
